WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.758
What a manager is. Before, your job was your own work.

2
00:00:04.808 --> 00:00:08.691
Now it is your team’s work, and the people who do it.

3
00:00:08.741 --> 00:00:12.848
Three things are new. You decide what matters this week.

4
00:00:12.898 --> 00:00:18.117
You approve timecards, time off, and expenses, so look before you sign.

5
00:00:18.167 --> 00:00:25.168
And you are responsible for people: fair treatment, a safe place to speak up, a chance to grow.

6
00:00:25.218 --> 00:00:30.660
You do not have to know everything. You do have to show up as the manager.

